 "quests": [
  {
   "copper": 6,
   "description": "A root feeds a troll, a troll tends the roots; the Small Jungle Boars have skipped their half of the bargain. Kill eight by day in the Kapok Yam Beds north of Kapok; their yellow names mean they leave you alone until you strike. Watch the rain offerings while you hunt, too. Yams go missing into bellies, but carved beads have been disappearing as well.",
   "giver": "r14_troll_elder",
   "giver_name": "Zalima Rainhum",
   "giver_settlement": "Kapok",
   "id": "kapok_hunt_01",
   "min_level": 1,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 8 small_boar [in kragmar_kapok_cradle/yam_beds]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "kragmar_kapok_cradle/yam_beds",
     "count": 8,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:small_boar"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "A Boar Has No Use for Beads",
   "turnin": "r14_troll_elder",
   "xp": 105
  },
  {
   "copper": 2,
   "description": "Hear that quiet pot? That is the sound of no supper. Chop trees outside town and bring me five logs of any kind, not planks; the trees in town stay standing, unless you plan to hold up our shade yourself.",
   "giver": "r20_troll_start_cook",
   "giver_name": "Zemi Sweetroot",
   "giver_settlement": "Kapok",
   "id": "kapok_kitchen_01",
   "min_level": 1,
   "objectives": [
    "bring 5 group:tree"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 5,
     "group": "tree",
     "type": "item"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "The Pot Is Waiting",
   "turnin": "r20_troll_start_cook",
   "xp": 30
  },
  {
   "copper": 2,
   "description": "Before you wrestle the jungle, give your hands something sensible to hold. Craft a Wooden Axe and a Wooden Pickaxe, then bring me one of each to inspect. I will give you a pair back; I teach with my hands, too, and have no use for yours beaten flat against a tree.",
   "giver": "r14_troll_elder",
   "giver_name": "Zalima Rainhum",
   "giver_settlement": "Kapok",
   "id": "kapok_tools_01",
   "min_level": 1,
   "objectives": [
    "bring 1 grug_materials:axe_wood",
    "bring 1 grug_materials:pick_wood"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 1,
     "item": "grug_materials:axe_wood",
     "type": "item"
    },
    {
     "count": 1,
     "item": "grug_materials:pick_wood",
     "type": "item"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [],
   "reward_items": [
    "grug_materials:axe_wood 1",
    "grug_materials:pick_wood 1"
   ],
   "title": "Save Your Knuckles",
   "turnin": "r14_troll_elder",
   "xp": 30
  },
  {
   "copper": 6,
   "description": "The boars sleep, the Large Kapok Rats wake, and our yams get no peace at all. Kill eight rats after dark in the Kapok Yam Beds north of Kapok. Pick your fights carefully: one squeak calls nearby rats, and they are a very attentive family.",
   "giver": "r14_troll_elder",
   "giver_name": "Zalima Rainhum",
   "giver_settlement": "Kapok",
   "id": "kapok_hunt_02",
   "min_level": 2,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 8 large_rat [in kragmar_kapok_cradle/yam_beds]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "kragmar_kapok_cradle/yam_beds",
     "count": 8,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:large_rat"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "kapok_hunt_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "One Squeak, Many Cousins",
   "turnin": "r14_troll_elder",
   "xp": 105
  },
  {
   "copper": 3,
   "description": "Rain drums on my roof, hungry trolls drum on my table, and neither will wait for damp wood. Mine five Coal Lumps from the rock outside town and bring them here. When you use the oven, coal goes in the fuel slot and food in the cooking slot; I already have enough complaints without serving fuel.",
   "giver": "r20_troll_start_cook",
   "giver_name": "Zemi Sweetroot",
   "giver_settlement": "Kapok",
   "id": "kapok_kitchen_02",
   "min_level": 2,
   "objectives": [
    "bring 5 default:coal_lump"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 5,
     "item": "default:coal_lump",
     "type": "item"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "kapok_kitchen_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Heat Before Hospitality",
   "turnin": "r20_troll_start_cook",
   "xp": 60
  },
  {
   "copper": 3,
   "description": "Moss makes every rock look welcoming; your pick will tell you which ones mean it. Use your Wooden Pickaxe on rock it can break outside town, then craft a Stone Axe and a Stone Pickaxe. Bring me one of each, and I will give you a pair back for the digging ahead.",
   "giver": "r14_troll_elder",
   "giver_name": "Zalima Rainhum",
   "giver_settlement": "Kapok",
   "id": "kapok_tools_02",
   "min_level": 2,
   "objectives": [
    "bring 1 grug_materials:axe_stone",
    "bring 1 grug_materials:pick_stone"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
