   ],
   "reward_items": [
    "grug_materials:axe_stone 1",
    "grug_materials:pick_stone 1"
   ],
   "title": "A Lesson Under the Moss",
   "turnin": "r14_troll_elder",
   "xp": 60
  },
  {
   "copper": 6,
   "description": "Listen in the Kapok Rootways after dark, in the north of Kapok Cradle: rats scurry, but Braindead Zombies drag their feet. Kill six zombies before they shuffle into somebody's doorway. Sunlight burns them, but I would rather trust your hands than wait for a clear morning.",
   "giver": "r14_troll_elder",
   "giver_name": "Zalima Rainhum",
   "giver_settlement": "Kapok",
   "id": "kapok_hunt_03",
   "min_level": 3,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 6 braindead_zombie [in kragmar_kapok_cradle/rootways]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "kragmar_kapok_cradle/rootways",
     "count": 6,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:braindead_zombie"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "kapok_hunt_02"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "The Roots Remember Feet",
   "turnin": "r14_troll_elder",
   "xp": 135
  },
  {
   "copper": 3,
   "description": "My yam sacks have more holes than sack, thanks to the Large Kapok Rats. Hunt them after dark in the Kapok Yam Beds north of Kapok and bring me two Rat Fur Patches for repairs. Keep any spare patches for armour; tonight those rats are supplying two trades and ruining neither.",
   "giver": "r20_troll_start_cook",
   "giver_name": "Zemi Sweetroot",
   "giver_settlement": "Kapok",
   "id": "kapok_pantry_01",
   "min_level": 3,
   "objectives": [
    "bring 2 grug_mobs:rat_fur_patch"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 2,
     "item": "grug_mobs:rat_fur_patch",
     "type": "item"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "kapok_hunt_02"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "You Chew It, You Patch It",
   "turnin": "r20_troll_start_cook",
   "xp": 60
  },
  {
   "copper": 3,
   "description": "You can hunt, but can I leave you alone with supper? Put five pieces of Raw Meat in the oven by my hearth, cook them, and bring me the five Meat. Learn this well and you will always have friends arriving just as the pot is ready.",
   "giver": "r20_troll_start_cook",
   "giver_name": "Zemi Sweetroot",
   "giver_settlement": "Kapok",
   "id": "kapok_kitchen_03",
