   "title": "What the Fire Leaves",
   "turnin": "r14_troll_elder",
   "xp": 83
  },
  {
   "copper": 7,
   "description": "The Kapok Thornwood, in the southeast of Kapok Cradle, teaches a harsher lesson than the yam beds. Kill eight Aggressive Jungle Boars there by day; a red name means they will start the fight without asking. Take them one at a time, and watch for Monstrous Vipers among the vines. Wisdom is mostly noticing the second set of teeth.",
   "giver": "r14_troll_elder",
   "giver_name": "Zalima Rainhum",
