   "title": "Two Voices in the Fire",
   "turnin": "r14_troll_elder",
   "xp": 130
  },
  {
   "copper": 9,
   "description": "Our rain beads have become lucky charms for sale at the Kapok Thieves' Camp southeast from here. Kill six Confused Offering Thieves there and their leader, Confused Offering Thief Chief Tangle, at the camp's centre. More thieves will come to fill the gaps, so do not wait for an empty camp before you face Tangle. Let us see how much luck a stolen bead can buy.",
